===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|US}} An [[adhesive]] [[label]] or [[decal]], usually applied to the bumper or back end of an automobile, and displaying a short political, promotional, philosophical, or humorous message.
#: {{syn|en|car-sticker|q1=UK}}
#: {{uxi|en|He has a '''bumper sticker''' on his van that reads "faster than a speeding ticket".}}
# {{lb|en|US|figurative}} Said of [[can]]ned insight; a [[slogan]] or [[saying]] that is [[trite]] or lacks [[depth]].
#: {{uxi|en|'''bumper-sticker''' philosophy}}

